    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_language_a_select_01",
      "hash64": "5CD5EE18BF0E6821",
      "text": "Absolument !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_language_a_select_02",
      "hash64": "5CD5EB18BF0E6308",
      "text": "« Tout ce chemin » ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_language_a_03",
      "hash64": "96408A3C202A572C",
      "text": "Ha ha ! J’ai donc enfin réussi à me faire apprécier\\nde mes adorables élèves ! I am so happy ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_language_a_04",
      "hash64": "9640893C202A5579",
      "text": "Je l’ai déjà dit en cours, mais la communication,\\nc’est très important ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_language_a_05",
      "hash64": "9640883C202A53C6",
      "text": "Donc si jamais tu rencontres des difficultés\\nen cours, ou que tu as des ennuis à l’école...[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_language_a_06",
      "hash64": "9640873C202A5213",
      "text": "... sache que tu peux toujours compter sur moi.\\nAlors, n’hésite pas à venir me voir ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
